<title>FINLAND: Finnish September PPI falls 1.8 pct yr/yr - SF.</title>
<headline>Finnish September PPI falls 1.8 pct yr/yr - SF.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish industry's producer price index rose 0.1 percent in September on August, but it fell 1.8 percent year-on-year, Statistics Finland said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>			   Sept 1996    August 1996	Sept 1995</p>
<p>   Mth/Mth		+0.1 pct	-0.4 pct	  +0.6 pct</p>
<p>   Yr/Yr		  -1.8 pct	-1.3 pct	  +3.2 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
